    <panel_attributes>*Command pattern*
Command: InventoryCommand
Concrete commands: AddItemCommand,
UpdateItemCommand, RemoveItemCommand,
CookRecipeCommand, OfferItemCommand,
ClaimItemCommand
Invoker: CommandHistory (one undo
stack per member, kept in memory)
Receiver: InventoryService
Client: FridgemateFacade
Each command stores what it needs
for undo(), e.g. RemoveItemCommand
keeps the removed item.
Withdrawing an F15 offer runs
OfferItemCommand.undo(). Claims are
final, so ClaimItemCommand is not
added to the undo history.
bg=#FFFFE0</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes></additional_attributes>
